; Limit 07: L0 types cannot describe a C signature.
; Blocks job 6. The OS calls the stack-overflow handler as
; void handler(int sig, siginfo_t *info, void *ctx): a 32-bit parameter and no
; return value. Every L0 function is i64 (i64, ...) -> i64 (spec section 10.1),
; and there is no 32-bit type, pointer type, or void.

(def stack_overflow_handler ((sig i32) (info int) (ctx int)) void
  0)
